ui ne s'embo\u00eete pas"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Je reste seul, condamn\u00e9 \u00e0 aimer sans \u00e9cho"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}